# iCloud Drive conflict copies. Syncing the same file from two machines leaves
# "CLAUDE 2.md" / "api 3.ts" next to the original — 37 of them at last count, and
# `git add -A src/` has picked them up before. Ignored rather than deleted: they
# are the sync's business, not the repo's.
* [2-9].*
* 1[0-9].*
# Extensionless originals too, e.g. "server/.gitignore 2".
